    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_98f76fc2",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: the_only_fuck_i_have_left_to_give_andddddd_there_it_goes; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a soldier in military gear, raising one arm in a gesture that appears to be throwing something, with text overlay that reads \"the only fuck i have left to give\" and \"andddddd there it goes.\" The overall intent is to convey a sense of exhaustion or resignation, often used humorously or ironically to express giving one's last effort or resources. The meme does not contain any explicit toxic or harmful content targeting specific protected groups (e.g., race, gender, religion, etc.) as defined in the provided knowledge base. However, the use of the word \"fuck\" and the crude phrasing may be considered offensive or inappropriate in certain contexts, which could potentially cause discomfort or harm to some viewers. The intent is not abusive, cyberbullying, propaganda, or misogynistic, but the language used may be deemed harmful due to its vulgar nature. The visual metaphor maps the act of throwing something (possibly a grenade or a symbolic object) onto the textual expression of giving one's last effort, creating a humorous or dramatic effect.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_aa3a523e"
